    "created_at": "2025-10-07T12:43:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-07T12:43:48Z",
    "body": "Do we know how often the constructor is used? An alternative might be to not honor the `origin` dictionary member at all and make the `origin` getter return a serialization of the `Origin` object.",
